exports[`template magic-link > matches the English snapshot > text 1`] = `
"CauseDeck


SIGN IN TO CAUSEDECK

Use the button below to sign in. The link expires in 10 minutes and works once.

Sign in https://app.causedeck.test/api/auth/magic-link/verify?token=abc&callbackURL=%2F

If the button does not work, open this link:

https://app.causedeck.test/api/auth/magic-link/verify?token=abc&callbackURL=%2F

If you did not ask to sign in, you can ignore this email.

----------------------------------------

You received this email because of your CauseDeck account.

This is a required account email and cannot be turned off."
`;

